<item><title>Activation, Occupancy and Partnership Opportunities at the Mid North Coast High Performance Centre</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Kempsey Shire Council is seeking proposals from suitable community organisations for the Activation, Occupancy and Partnership Opportunity at the Mid North Coast High Performance Centre (MNCHPC).<br /><br />The High Performance Centre (HPC) is a strategically significant Council asset developed to support sport, recreation, health, education and community outcomes across the Kempsey Shire and wider Mid North Coast region. Respondents may propose lease, licence, shared-use, partnership or alternative arrangements that support the effective use of the facility.<br /><br />Council encourages proposals from both:<br /><br /> - Not for Profit organisations<br /><br /> - Commercial organisations<br /><br />All information is available upon procurement documentation download.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Kempsey Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523941<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Event Management & Services, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services, Training & Development, Travel & Tourism, Venue Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
