<item><title>Campbells Corner Redevelopment - Design and Construct</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Muswellbrook Shire Council seeks to engage a suitably qualified and experienced contractor for the design finalisation and construction of the Campbell’s Corner Redevelopment Project in Muswellbrook.<br /><br /> <br /><br />The project primarily involves the refurbishment of the vacant retail space within the Campbells Corner building, formerly occupied by the IGA Supermarket, to provide purpose-built Council Chambers and a Boardroom, with the remaining area repurposed as a fresh produce supermarket. The works also include the construction of a new entry from Bridge Street and modifications to the existing vacant café tenancy.<br /><br /> <br /><br />A mandatory pre-tender meeting and site inspection has been scheduled for Friday, 11 September 2026. Please confirm your attendance by emailing the below address:<br /><br />procurement@muswellbrook.nsw.gov.au<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Muswellbrook Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524042<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 20]]></description>
