<item><title>Online Timesheet &amp; Rostering (CWT202600628)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of West Torrens is looking to move its rostering and timesheets to an online centralised system that also incorporates an award interpreter. The aim is to streamline payroll, enhance data quality, remove manual processes and create an improved user experience. A new system must work in conjunction with Chris21 which will remain as our core payroll system.<br /><br />Refer to RFQ documents for additional information.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of West Torrens<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+09:30) Adelaide time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523752<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
