<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 12:32:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Architecture, Design, Planning</category>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>Events Panel for Infrastructure, AV, Staging &amp; structures, Lighting, Crew, Production</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> South Bank Corporation is seeking to establish a panel of qualified and experienced suppliers to support the delivery of its annual events, activations and public programming across the South Bank precinct.<br /><br />South Bank is one of Queensland's most visited destinations and delivers a diverse calendar of events ranging from small community activations and wellness programs to large-scale public festivals, outdoor concerts, cultural celebrations and strategic partnerships.<br /><br />To support these activities, the Customer intends to appoint suppliers to a supply panel consisting of six categories of goods and/or service:<br /><br />•	Category A – Temporary Event Infrastructure Requirements<br /><br />•	Category B – Staging, Structures and Rigging<br /><br />•	Category C – Audio Production and Sound Services Requirements<br /><br />•	Category D – Lighting, Vision and Special Effects Requirements<br /><br />•	Category E – Event Production and Technical Management Requirements<br /><br />•	Category F – ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> South Bank Corporation<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523909<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Audio Visual Photo Equip & Supp., Electronic Components & Supplies, Event Management & Services, Furniture & Furnishings, Plant & Equipment - Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
