<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This project is located at Clive Street, Fernvale. The aim of the project is to widen a section of Clive Street, from Chatham St intersection to the Brisbane Valley Rail Trail intersection, including but not limited to the following:<br /><br />•	Earthworks <br /><br />•	Road pavement construction including seal<br /><br />•	Drainage, landscape, line marking, kerbs, concrete works<br /><br />•	Managing works adjacent to PUP<br /><br />•	Traffic Management<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Somerset Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 23/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523799<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
