<guid isPermaLink="false">ca64ffa1eedd45958ea0c15846e3dba7</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 06:05:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Healthcare Services</category>
</item>
<item><title>Service Review Framework</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Boroondara is seeking a suitably experienced provider to work with Council to develop a Service Review Framework (Part 1), with the option to subsequently extend the Framework to incorporate a Service Planning Approach (Part 2).<br /><br />Part 1 – Service Review Framework<br /><br />1.	Part 1.A – Development of the Framework<br /><br />The provider will develop a practical, fit-for-purpose Service Review Framework that establishes a consistent approach to planning and undertaking service reviews across Council, including the methodology, tools and supporting resources required to undertake future service reviews. <br /><br />The Framework should complement Council’s Benefits Framework by supporting the identification, assessment and tracking of benefits from review recommendations, and enable insights and opportunities identified through reviews to inform ongoing service improvement. <br /><br />The Framework, associated resources and intellectual property will be owned by Council and will provid...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Boroondara<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523400<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
