<item><title>Provision of Assessment Services in South Asia</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Provision of Assessment Services in South Asia <br /><br />Queensland University of Technology (QUT) invites Offers from suitably qualified and experienced suppliers for the provision of admissions assessment services in South Asia, initially focused on India.<br /><br />QUT is seeking a supplier to establish and operate an independent admissions assessment capability, including workforce, facilities and operational support, to assist with the assessment of international student applications.<br /><br />Services are expected to include Genuine Student assessments, applicant interviews, document verification and authentication, assessment of supporting documentation, reporting, quality assurance and market insights. QUT will retain ownership of admissions policy, governance and final admissions decision-making.<br /><br />The initial contract term will be two (2) years, with options for extension at QUT's discretion.<br /><br />Further details are available in the Request for Offer (RFO) documentation. A Suppl...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland University of Technology<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523584<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : HR Services & Recruitment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
