<item><title>Expression of Interest - Mount Peter Sewer Rising Main</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The purpose of this EOI is to engage with industry prior to commencing the formal procurement process to better understand market capability, capacity, appetite and potential risks associated with the delivery of the Mount Peter Sewer Rising Main project. <br /><br />The EOI will seek feedback on the proposed scope, delivery approach, packaging options, procurement strategy, risk allocation and social procurement requirements to ensure the project is structured in a manner that maximises competition, encourages innovation and delivers value for money. Information obtained through the EOI will be used to inform and refine the procurement strategy and tender documentation prior to release to market in FY27.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Economic Development Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 15/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523579<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
