<item><title>Narrandera Urban Stormwater Upgrade Main drainage construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council (the Principal) is seeking tender responses from qualified tenderers for the construction of Narrandera Urban Stormwater Upgrade project and associated works to address flooding problems within Narrandera Township.<br /><br />The basic Scope of Works involves the construction of approximately 1,300m of Reinforced Concrete Box Culverts (RCBC), pits and associated pipework to intercept flows in Bolton Street (between Charles and Willans Streets) and transfer them to the existing stormwater basin (located between Larmer Street and the Main Irrigation Canal). A detailed scope of works is provided in Volume 3 – Statement of Requirements.<br /><br />The successful tenderer shall provide all materials, equipment, operators, labourers, traffic control plans, project site compound, including coordination with all authorities (utility providers, other private and government agencies), approvals, and all applicable fees to carry out the Works. The successful tenderer shall also allow for the disposal and carting...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Narrandera Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 12/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522657<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
