<item><title>Request for Information - Workstations on Wheels Replacement Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The primary objective of this Request for Information (RFI) is to undertake market engagement and provide Children’s Health Queensland (CHQ) with an understanding of the current Workstation on Wheels (WOW) solutions available in the market.<br /><br />Suppliers who respond to this RFI will be invited to participate in a Supplier Roadshow. The roadshow will provide suppliers with an opportunity to demonstrate their WoW solutions, capabilities, equipment and proposed configurations directly to CHQ's key clinical, technical and operational stakeholders.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Children's Health QLD Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523243<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms, Medical Equipment. & Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
