<item><title>Request for Quotation: Temporary Infrastructure for New Year’s Eve 2026-27</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Provide infrastructure for New Year’s Eve 2026-27 at six harbour-side vantage points in the Woollahra Council LGA. <br /><br />Suppliers may quote for any or all of the following service categories:<br /><br />1.	Portable Toilets – Hire, delivery, installation, servicing and collection<br /><br />42 x standard units, 3 x accessible units.<br /><br />2.	Lighting Towers and Generator – Hire, delivery, installation and collection<br /><br />13 x lighting towers<br /><br />3.	Temporary Fencing – Supply, installation, dismantling and collection<br /><br />Approx 1,200 metres<br /><br />Please indicate clearly on your response which category(ies) above you are quoting for.<br /><br />Full specifications are provided in the attached Request For Quote document and detailed site maps.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Woollahra Municipal Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523218<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Event Management & Services, Plant & Equipment - Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
