<item><title>Roof Renewal Program - Separable Portions</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Cassowary Coast Regional Council invites quotations from suitably qualified and licensed roofing contractors to undertake roof renewal works across four Council facilities.<br /><br />The Works are divided into four separable portions:<br /><br />Portion 1 – Cardwell Lions Club Hall: Partial roof replacement, purlin replacement and eastern gable-end cladding replacement.<br /><br />Portion 2 – See Poy Building, Pease Park: Complete roof rescrew.<br /><br />Portion 3 – Callendar Park: Partial roof replacement and box gutter rectification.<br /><br />Portion 4 – Mission Beach Library: Complete roof rescrew, partial roof replacement and box gutter works.<br /><br />Respondents may quote for one, several or all portions. Council may award the portions individually or in any combination.<br /><br />Questions close: 3pm Wednesday, 23 September 2026<br /><br />Quotations close: 3pm Friday, 25 September 2026<br /><br />.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Cassowary Coast Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523217<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Tanisha Derrick Email: tanisha.derrick@ccrc.qld.gov.au Tel: 0429323373<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
