</item>
<item><title>Ecotourism Opportunities in Queensland</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This project seeks to identify and prioritise ecotourism opportunities in Queensland that are globally competitive, aligned with visitor demand, and capable of delivering strong conservation outcomes. It will provide the government and tourism industry with a set of clear and evidence-based recommendations on where Queensland is best positioned to compete and succeed in ecotourism, and which opportunities should be prioritised to maximise economic, environmental and visitor outcomes.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Tourism and Events Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523182<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
