<item><title>CTWW043 - 25/26 - Maryborough Landfill - Alternate Day Cover</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> OVERVIEW<br /><br />Fraser Coast Regional Council is inviting offers from suitably qualified and experienced Tenderers for manufacture, supply, delivery and initial unloading and placement of Alternative Daily Landfill Covers at Maryborough Landfill (269 Ariadne Street, Maryborough, QLD 4650) including onsite training.<br /><br />The Principal may award whole of the contract to a single Tenderer. <br /><br /><br />SUBMISSION OF TENDER DOCUMENTS<br /><br />Please be advised that tender response forms are to be submitted as two files only and in the following format:<br /><br />- Non-Price Response Form: PDF including all supporting documentation as one file. This PDF must not contain any price related criteria.<br /><br />- Price Response Form: Excel<br /><br />Failure to comply with this requirement may result in a non-conforming offer.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Fraser Coast Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Sep/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522726<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
