<item><title>102.2026.14 - 2025/2026 Flood Damaged Roads Restoration</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Flinders Shire Council invites tenders from suitably qualified and experienced contractors for appointment to a panel for the delivery of flood damaged road restoration and associated works across the Flinders Shire municipality.<br /><br />Submission of a Tender does not automatically result in appointment to the Panel. Following evaluation of Tenders, the Principal may select one or more Tenderers for appointment to the Panel in accordance with the Procurement Process Conditions.<br /><br />Each successful Tenderer will be required to enter into a Panel Contract with the Principal before becoming eligible to receive Work Orders.<br /><br />Appointment to the Panel does not guarantee a Contractor any minimum quantity, value or number of Work Orders, does not provide exclusivity and does not entitle a Contractor to an equal share of work.<br /><br />The pre-tender meeting will be held at 9.00am on Wednesday, 2 September 2026. You can attend this meeting at the Meeting Room, Diggers Entertainment Centre or via...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Flinders Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523110<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
