<item><title>RFT000040 Description: Electronic Document and Records Management System (EDRMS)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Principal is seeking to procure an Electronic Document and Records Management System (EDRMS) solution and associated implementation services. The scope includes solution design, configuration, implementation, training, support, and migration of records and metadata from legacy systems, including TechnologyOne ECM and Objective. The procurement is vendor agnostic and is intended to identify the solution and delivery partner best able to support compliant, secure and sustainable records management across the Port’s Microsoft 365 and SharePoint environment.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Port of Townsville Limited<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 21/Sep/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522807<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
