</item>
<item><title>Request for Tender - Cleaning Services of Public Facilities in Shire of Kondinin</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Shire of Kondinin manages a broad range of community, tourism and operational facilities across Kondinin, Karlgarin and Hyden, including key visitor destinations such as Wave Rock, The Humps and McCann’s Rock. These facilities include administration offices, depots, the Kondinin Caravan Park, community halls, sporting facilities, barbeque areas and public toilets.<br /><br />Clean, safe and well-presented facilities are essential to supporting community use, workplace operations and the visitor experience. Regular cleaning also helps protect public health, maintain Shire assets and ensure facilities remain suitable for residents, staff, contractors and visitors.<br /><br />Through this Request for Tender, the Shire is seeking a suitably qualified and reliable contractor/s located within a 50km radius of the Shire of Kondinin to provide consistent cleaning services across the nominated facilities. The services are required to meet agreed cleaning frequencies, respond to seasonal and booking-related demand,...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Shire of Kondinin<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Sep/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522959<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
