<item><title>Annual Pest Management Services – Tamworth Regional Council Public Swimming Pool Facilities</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tamworth Regional Council is seeking quotations from suitably licensed pest management contractors to undertake annual pest treatment services at six public swimming pool facilities.<br /><br />The service includes inspection and treatment of spiders, cockroaches and ants across internal and external areas including amenities, changerooms, offices, plant rooms, storage areas, building perimeters, seating areas, fencing, gardens, bin compounds and associated infrastructure.<br /><br />The contractor is to provide all labour, supervision, travel, equipment, materials, chemicals, reporting and documentation required to complete the works. All travel, accommodation, mobilisation and associated costs are to be included in the submitted rates.<br /><br />The annual pest treatment program must be completed by 12 October 2026.<br /><br />Facilities included under this RFQ are:<br /><br />- Barraba Memorial Swimming Pool Complex<br /><br />- Kootingal Memorial Swimming Pool<br /><br />- Manilla Memorial Swimming Pool<...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Tamworth Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Sep/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520686<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
