<item><title>Panel Tender for the Provision of Project Management Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Dubbo Regional Council invites Tenders from suitably qualified and experienced organisations for appointment to a Panel for the provision of Project Management Services<br /><br />.<br /><br />The Panel will operate for an initial term of three (3) years, with one option available to the Principal to extend the Panel for a further period of up to two (2) years.<br /><br />This is an Open Panel Contract that will establish a selected list of approved Project Management Organisation to undertake the scope requirements, without limiting the principal’s rights in the Conditions of Contract, to accept new suppliers during the contract period following an additional public tender process.<br /><br />The Panel may be utilised by any business unit, department or functional area of Council during the term of the Panel.<br /><br />Appointment to the Panel does not guarantee any minimum volume or value of work. Council may engage one or more Panel Suppliers at its discretion throughout the term of the Panel.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Dubbo Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522588<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
