<item><title>T26/013 Council Meeting Management Solution</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Georges River Council is seeking submissions from suitably qualified and experienced companies to procure, implement, configure, support and maintain a modern, secure, cloud-based Council Meeting Management Solution to support the end-to-end management of Council and Committee meetings.<br /><br />The solution will streamline meeting administration processes, improve governance and transparency, enhance Councillor and staff user experience, and ensure compliance with the Local Government Act 1993 (NSW), Government Information (Public Access) Act 2009 (GIPA), State Records Act 1998 and other relevant legislative and regulatory requirements.<br /><br />The solution will replace and/or enhance existing meeting management processes and provide an integrated platform for agenda preparation, workflow management, meeting distribution, minute taking, resolution tracking, voting management and public access to meeting information.<br /><br />The successful respondent/s will enter into an agreement with Council for the...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Georges River Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 15/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522551<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
