<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Winton Shire Council invites tenderers to make submissions for sealing works as part of the Disaster Recovery Works on various roads across the entire Shire. Package 12 consists of approximately 90 individual sites along Ayshire Road (Town Bypass), Blomfield Street , Dinosaur Drive, Ayrshire Road, Winton Jundah Road, Chirnside Street, Cork Mail Road, Cork Street, Dagworth Street, Elderslie Street, Fraser Street, Lark Quarry Access, Oondooroo Street, Vindex Street and Wilson Street.<br /><br />The works required are a mixture of two coat bitumen spray seals, crack repairs, edge repairs, patch repairs, pothole repairs, pavement repairs and insitu-stabilisation works, which includes 50mm correction, reconstruction of unbound granular pavement, heavy shoulder grading incorporating 50mm of imported material.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Winton Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522446<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Management Advisory Services, Plant & Equipment - Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
