<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Ipswich City Council is seeking to engage one or more suitably experienced and qualified Contractors to undertake the required restoration works across multiple locations throughout the LGA. The works will be carried out via two separable portions as follows:<br /><br />•	Separable Portion 1: Gravel Roads<br /><br />•	Separable Portion 2: Sealed Ancillary Roads<br /><br />The award of the separable portions to one or more contractors will be based on the risk associated with the proposed project timeframes for each portion in meeting QRA delivery requirements being met and value for money outcomes.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Ipswich<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Sep/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521879<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 16]]></description>
