<item><title>ITO | Electrical Course Supplies</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> TAFE Queensland is seeking offers from suitably qualified suppliers for the provision and delivery of electrical course supplies across its six Queensland regions. The resulting Standing Offer Arrangement is expected to commence in February 2027 for an initial three year term, with extension options available. Suppliers must be able to supply a broad range of electrical training goods and deliver to multiple TAFE Queensland campus locations throughout Queensland.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> TAFE Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522355<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
