<item><title>Expression of Interest - Future Use of Land at Loganholme Tourism Precinct and Cronulla Park</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Logan City Council is seeking Expressions of Interest from qualified proponents for the future development of two key strategic landholdings at Loganholme and Slacks Creek. These sites represent significant opportunities to deliver high-value outcomes that support long-term economic, community and social benefits.<br /><br />The EOI process aims to identify suitable proponents who can contribute to the sustainable development, activation, and ongoing enhancement of these precincts, supporting community engagement and economic growth within the region.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Logan City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Oct/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521982<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Real Estate & Property Services, Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
