<item><title>ITT2610 Supply of Vector Control Products</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited for the supply and delivery of vector control products for Council’s Vector Control Management Plan to manage mosquitos on public land.<br /><br />Council regularly conducts larvicidal treatments and remains ready to undertake adulticide treatments through disaster response protocols. The mosquito management program operates all year; however, mosquito activity and subsequent treatments are generally from August through to May.<br /><br />This is a schedule of rates contract for an initial period of two (2) years, commencing on 15 October 2026 with two (2) twelve-month extension options to provide Council with Vector products on an as needs basis.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 15/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522084<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Chemicals, Biochemical, Gas, Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
