<item><title>IRC-IS-0526-T475 Residential Renewals Moranbah</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Isaac Regional Council (Council) is seeking qualified contractors to undertake residential renovation works across three (3) unoccupied properties. The primary objective of this project is to bring these homes/properties up to current living and safety standards. The request for tender has two (2) separable portions. Council may award to individual contractors for each Portion, or to a sole contractor for the entirety of the works.<br /><br />The Separable Portions are:<br /><br />Separable Portion A <br /><br />- Unit 05, 17 Utah Dr, Moranbah QLD 4744<br /><br />- Unit 23, 17 Utah Dr, Moranbah QLD 4744<br /><br />Separable Portion B <br /><br />- 37 Kennedy St, Moranbah QLD 4744<br /><br />Mandatory Site Meeting 1 September 2026, see tender documents for further information. <br /><br />Tender Closes 2pm 14 September 2026. <br /><br />Kind Regards, <br /><br />Isaac Regional Council<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Isaac Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522267<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
