<item><title>Design and Construct - Warwick Specialist Clinic Redesign</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Request for Tender invites suitably qualified Principal Contractors to submit a tender for two separate portions of works under a Design and Construct arrangement for a Specialist Clinic outpatient centre.<br /><br />The project aims to deliver a more compliant, functional and future-ready environment that supports both current and projected service needs.<br /><br />All works must align with the current design standards set out in the Australasian Health Facility Guidelines.<br /><br />The project will address a range of existing deficiencies, including:<br /><br />- a shortfall of compliant consult rooms<br /><br />- undefined and inadequate patient waiting areas<br /><br />- dysfunctional reception areas and workspaces<br /><br />- limited and poorly configured treatment spaces<br /><br />A mandatory site visit has been scheduled for 28 August 2026. Refer to the attached Request for Tender documents for further project details, including registration requirements for the site visit.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Darling Downs Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Sep/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522207<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 24]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=d26904d544d84089adaadfb006081b69s522207</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">d26904d544d84089adaadfb006081b69</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 05:13:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Architecture, Design, Planning</category>
