<item><title>VP521151 Cannonvale Community Hub – Access Road</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The project is inclusive of all works described in the design documentation as required to construct and maintain a new fully functional and operational road and parkland at 42-46 Galbraith Park Drive, Cannon Valley 4802 (Lot 902 on SP173637). <br /><br />A non-mandatory Tender Site Briefing will be held Thursday 27th August 2026, 10.00am. The location of the meeting is Galbraith Park, Galbraith Park Drive, Cannonvale 4802, meeting at the Picnic table.<br /><br />N.B. PPE is a requirement to attend this site, at a minimum Hi-Vis long-sleeved shirt, full length pants, steel cap boots and eye protection, it is also recommended to wear sun protection.<br /><br />Please confirm your attendance at this meeting via contracts@whitsundayrc.qld.gov.au no later than midday, Wednesday, 26th August 2026.<br /><br />All communications must go through the VendorPanel communications forum.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Whitsunday Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521151<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
