<item><title>Provision of Services to Test RCDs (Residual Charge Devices) at Council Facilities</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Goondiwindi Regional Council seeks the services of an experienced Electrician to test Residual Charge Devices (RCDs) in accordance with Australian Standard AS3760 at Council facilities across the region for a period of six (6) years.<br /><br />As per 1.9.1	Respondents can apply for either or both of the following Schedules:<br /><br />i.	Schedule 1 – Council Facilities located at Yelarbon, Goondiwindi, Toobeah, Bungunya, Talwood, Weengallon. <br /><br />ii.	Schedule 2 – Council Facilities located at Inglewood and Texas.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Goondiwindi Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522129<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
