<item><title>Supply and Delivery of One Articulated Motor Grader</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Central Goldfields Shire Council invites tenders for the supply and delivery of one (1) new articulated diesel-powered Motor Grader for use in municipal road construction, renewal and maintenance throughout the Central Goldfields Shire municipality.<br /><br />The Grader will primarily operate on unsealed rural roads and, to a lesser extent, urban streets. Typical activities include road formation, gravel re-sheeting, maintenance grading, table drain construction and cleaning, scarifying, ripping, roadside maintenance and emergency works, including fire containment line construction.<br /><br />The Grader will be required to operate safely and reliably in a range of weather conditions, including prolonged operation in ambient temperatures up to 45°C.<br /><br />The successful Tenderer shall supply, deliver, commission and register the Grader ready for operational use.<br /><br />For detailed information see Request for Tender documents.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Goldfields Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522063<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
