<item><title>Design and Construct Killarney Gap Bridge</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This procurement aims to facilitate a contract that will deliver value for money for the Gwydir Shire Council. The Council is seeking Tenders from experienced Tenderers to design and construct a new bridge at Killarney Gap Bridge on Killarney Gap Road over Rocky Creek 50km east of Bingara.<br /><br />A Pre-Tender Meeting will be held on Friday, 28 August 2026, at 11:00 AM on site. Attendance at this meeting is mandatory, but all interested tenderers are encouraged to attend to better understand the project requirements and site conditions.<br /><br />As the meeting will take place on-site, all attendees are required to wear appropriate personal protective equipment (PPE), including hats, high-visibility clothing, and safety boots. Attendees should also adhere to all health and safety guidelines provided upon arrival at the site.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Gwydir Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522033<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 10]]></description>
