<item><title>Pre-Market Notification - Mackay and Rockhampton Emergency Helicopter Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Market Notification – Intention to release Invitation to Offer (ITO) – Mackay and Rockhampton Emergency Helicopter Services (VP510612).<br /><br />NOTE - This notice is for information only. No action is required. <br /><br />Queensland Health wishes to advise interested suppliers of an intention to release an ITO to the market for a single supplier to provide emergency helicopter services from Mackay and Rockhampton. The objectives of the intended procurement include achieving value for Queensland and taxpayers’ money and ensuring fair and open competition via an open tender procurement approach. The ITO will be a genuine opportunity to bid for the services and interest from all suitability qualified and experienced suppliers is welcomed and encouraged.<br /><br />The services sought encompass aeromedical patient transport including pre-hospital retrieval, inter-facility transfer, search and rescue, law enforcement and/or support to other government agencies as required.<br /><br />The anticipated timing for...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Health<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522003<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Aircraft & Aviation Services, Transport, Freight, Logistics<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
