<item><title>RFT000141- Gympie Regional Council 2026/ 27 In-situ Stabilising Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited from suitably qualified and experienced contractors to establish schedule rates and pricing for the delivery of in-situ pavement stabilisation works within the Gympie Regional Council local government area. The works form part of the Queensland Department of Transport and Main Roads (TMR) 2026/27 reseal preparation program and are required to improve pavement condition, structural performance, and long-term asset durability prior to the application of reseal treatments.<br /><br />The scope of work encompasses pavement stabilisation activities on two key transport routes located on the Wide Bay Highway and Gympie Woolooga Road.<br /><br />The successful contractor will be required to undertake the stabilisation works in accordance with the project specifications, relevant TMR standards, and all applicable legislative and safety requirements. Works are intended to provide a sound and uniform pavement platform suitable for the subsequent resealing operations scheduled under the 2026/27 progr...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Gympie Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521858<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
