<item><title>T2026-022 Woorabinda Gordon Henry Oval - Football Field, Buildings Services and Associated Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Woorabinda Aboriginal Shire Council invites suitably qualified and experienced contractors for the delivery of Stage 2 of the Gordon Henry Oval Facility.<br /><br />Stage 1 is the supply & installation of the modular clubhouse. (Works not within this tender)<br /><br />Stage 2 comprises the civil and landscape works to Field One, the supply and install of goal posts, scoreboard, coach and player seating, design and installation of electrical, water, sewer and drainage to the clubhouse and associated works as per the scope of works document.<br /><br />Works are to be completed in accordance with approved design documentation, applicable guidelines, and best-practice construction methods. Tender closing at 5.00 pm, Wednesday 9th September 2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Woorabinda Aboriginal Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Sep/2026 06:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521936<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
