<item><title>Mapoon Football Field</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Mapoon Aboriginal Shire Council (MASC) (the Principal) has executed a Funding Agreement with the Department of Sport, Racing and Olympic and Paralympic Games (DSROPG) to deliver upgrades to the Mapoon Football Field (the Project). <br /><br /> <br /><br />The current football field is a barren site with minimal infrastructure in place. The MASC wish to upgrade the existing football field at Mapoon conform with NRL Standards. <br /><br /> <br /><br />Please refer to attached documentation for further information.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mapoon Aboriginal Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521909<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Horticulture & Arboriculture, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
