<item><title>ITO | Linen Hire and Laundry Service</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> TAFE Queensland seeks to establish a Standing Offer Arrangement (SOA) with multiple suppliers for the provision of Linen Hire and Laundry Services.<br /><br />TAFE Queensland operates across six regions throughout Queensland, delivering practical, industry relevant training programs and supporting a diverse range of campus facilities. Five regions operate facilities including, but not limited to, training kitchens, hospitality training environments, student accommodation, healthcare training areas, and general campus amenities. These facilities require reliable, high quality linen hire and laundry services to support hygiene, presentation, and operational efficiency.<br /><br />Suppliers are invited to respond to this Invitation to Offer (ITO) in accordance with the requirements outlined in the attached documents.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> TAFE Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521769<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Domestic & Consumer ELEC, Personal & Domestic Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
