<item><title>Orchestra Pit Upgrade Construction Civic Theatre</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The works comprise the refurbishment of the existing stage and orchestra pit at the Civic Theatre, including the supply and installation of new floor finishes, stage components, lighting and associated electrical works. The project includes carpeting the orchestra pit with commercial-grade carpet tiles, replacing stair carpet to match the existing finish, installing compliant emergency signage, supplying and installing new stage traps, and providing recessed LED stage-edge lighting and illuminated stair lighting. All electrical works are to be fully compliant with relevant Australian Standards and legislative requirements. <br /><br /><br />A second site inspection will be held on Wednesday, 2 September 2026, commencing at 11:00 am.<br /><br />This inspection is being provided to allow subcontractors and prospective contractors who were unable to attend the initial pre-tender briefing to view the site and gain a firsthand understanding of the works required.<br /><br />Please note that this is not a formal pr...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Wagga Wagga City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521736<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 18]]></description>
