<item><title>PR000127 Lease (Operation &amp; Maintenance) of Aviation Fuel Supply Facility</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Charters Towers Regional Council invites tenders from suitably qualified and experienced operators for the lease, (operation and maintenance) of the aviation fuel supply facility at Charters Towers Airport. The successful proponent will be responsible for the supply and management of Avgas and Jet A1 fuel services, facility maintenance, regulatory compliance, environmental management, safety systems, and customer service. <br /><br />Further information can be found in the attached Tender documentation <br /><br />Tenders must be lodged electronically through VendorPanel <br /><br />Council reserves the right to invite all tenderers to change their tenders to take account of a change in the tender specification.<br /><br /> <br /><br />Council's representative for this tender is Paul Weston, Procurement & Depot Coordinator, who can be contacted on 07 4761 5300.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Charters Towers Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520335<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Aircraft & Aviation Services, Fuel & Oils<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
