<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking Tenders from appropriately qualified and experienced hospitality providers who have a proven track record of delivering high quality service to operate a restaurant/café located within Brays Bay Reserve, 443 Concord Road, Rhodes.<br /><br />A briefing/site inspection will be held as per the details below:<br /><br />- Date: 7 September 2026<br /><br />- Time: 2:30pm – 3:30pm<br /><br />Location: Brays Bay Reserve, 443 Concord Road, Rhodes<br /><br />Please confirm via the VendorPanel forum your attendance at this meeting no later than 5pm on Thursday the 3rd of September 2026.<br /><br />Attendance at this meeting is mandatory. Failure to attend this briefing/site inspection will leave the Tenderer ineligible to submit a Tender.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Canada Bay<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521147<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Catering & Hospitality, Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
