<item><title>Shire of Wiluna Road Maintenance Grading Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This is a contract for Road Maintenance Grading Services for the purpose of maintenance grading of unsealed roads and unsealed shoulders of sealed roads within the Shire of Wiluna.<br /><br />The works will typically be comprised of:<br /><br />•	Routine Maintenance Grading – maintain and improve the running surface, <br /><br />•	Periodic Maintenance Grading – repair surface and renew shoulders, table drains and diversion drains, and<br /><br />•	Specific Maintenance Grading – periodic maintenance scope works as agreed with the Principal.<br /><br />The scope of work may also include “Opening-up” grading works following adverse weather events.<br /><br />Typically, major connector roads may receive a full grade including drainage and surface works once or twice a year whilst some access roads may only be graded every 3 to 5 years – depending on changing volumes of traffic, flood or haulage damage.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Shire of Wiluna<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521375<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
