<guid isPermaLink="false">5ac75bc441b94c21aa6807710c0d565a</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 14:19:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>Shire of Wiluna RFT 2026-06 Operation of Wiluna Swimming Pool</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Shire of Wiluna is seeking Tenders from suitably qualified and experienced aquatic facility Operators to manage the Wiluna Swimming Pool (herein referred to as ‘the Pool’) which is a Class 1 facility as determined by the Health (Aquatic Facilities) Regulations 2007. The successful Contractor will need to demonstrate a willingness to work in partnership with the Shire and the local community in terms of provision of services and agreed programmes and activities.<br /><br />The provider is required to open and manage the Pool operation over a 27-week period from the end of September each year, to early April each year for at least 40 hrs per week over 6 days a week.<br /><br />The term of the contract will be for two (2) years with an option to extend the contract for a third (3rd) year based on performance.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Shire of Wiluna<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521368<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Event Management & Services, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
