<item><title>TEN/2893 Waste Facilities Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is inviting submissions from suitably qualified and experienced Suppliers for the provision of mechanical, hydraulic and associated maintenance services for Council's Waste Management and Resource Recovery Facilities.<br /><br />The majority of works will be undertaken at the Bundaberg Materials Recovery Facility and Bundaberg Waste Management Facility located on University Drive, Bundaberg. The successful Supplier will also be required to provide maintenance, repairs and breakdown support across Council's landfill and transfer station network as required.<br /><br />The Contract includes both scheduled preventative maintenance and reactive maintenance services. Key responsibilities will include the maintenance and repair of critical assets such as the MRF trommel, conveyor systems, balers, hydraulic equipment, motors, gearboxes, hydraulic tip wells, transfer station hydraulic gates and other operational plant and equipment. The Supplier may also be required to undertake inspections, fault diagnosis, ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Bundaberg Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520104<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Indust. Production, Manufacturing<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
