<item><title>Enterprise Governance, Risk and Compliance (GRC) Platform</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> WorkCover Queensland (WCQ) is seeking the provision and implementation of a modern Governance, Risk and Compliance (GRC) platform to ensure continuity of service, address current technology limitations, and support the organisation's risk maturity objectives and 2030 Strategy.<br /><br />The procurement seeks a Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) GRC solution that maintains existing risk and compliance capabilities while providing a scalable foundation for future enhancement. The successful Supplier will provide the GRC platform together with ongoing application management and support services, including platform maintenance, upgrades, incident management and technical support.<br /><br />WCQ also requires implementation services to transition from its current GRC platform and deliver the Transition State (further detailed in Part B – Statement of Requirements) of the new solution, including design, configuration, integration, testing, data migration support and defect resolution.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> WorkCover Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520108<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 15]]></description>
