<item><title>CN-26692 - 2026-27 SDRC Reseals for the Darling Downs District on the State and National Network</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Transport and Main Roads (TMR or the “Principal”) invites prequalified F5 category Tenderers to submit a Tender for Reseal works on the Darling Downs Network. There will not be a mandatory pre-lodgement conference for this Contract.<br /><br />To obtain documents, eligible prequalified contractors must email: dd_pc@tmr.qld.gov.au to apply for access, the relevant company ABN must be included in this email. Once approved, documentation will be made available at the BAS website: https://www.hpw.qld.gov.au/bas/etender/.<br /><br />Submissions are to be lodged electronically via the tender site https://www.hpw.qld.gov.au/bas/etender by 2:00pm on Tuesday 8th September 2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Dept of Transport and Main Roads-Darling Downs<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520234<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
