<item><title>Walcha Sewer Manhole Remediation</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> In 2023 Walcha Council undertook investigation works including maintenance hole inspections and<br /><br />smoke testing to identify sources of infiltration and inflow (I&I) within the Walcha sewer network.<br /><br />Walcha Council have identified priority manhole remediation locations and seeking to engage a qualified contractor to complete the works.<br /><br />The Works generally include:<br /><br />- Remediation of defective maintenance holes identified in the FITT inspection program;<br /><br />- Remediation of Council-owned defects identified through the smoke testing program;<br /><br />- Validation of asset condition and ownership;<br /><br />- Minor excavation, repair and reinstatement works associated with the above; and<br /><br />- Documentation and reporting to support Council’s asset management system.<br /><br />These works are to be completed prior to the end financial year 2026-2027.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Walcha Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520492<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 22]]></description>
