<item><title>Provision of Soil Nailing for Mungar Road Batter Slip</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Provision of soil nailing for Mungar Road Batter Slip<br /><br />Upslope:<br /><br />1)	Descaling the face. Strip topsoil & clear vegetation as required.<br /><br />2)	Supply & install soil nails, including grout & weepholes.<br /><br />3)	Shotcreting including supply & installation of mesh. <br /><br />Downslope:<br /><br />4)	Strip topsoil & clear vegetation.<br /><br />5)	General excavation & disposal of existing batter material. Excavation includes the removal of existing culvert end unit(s).<br /><br />6)	Supply & install lower embankment.<br /><br />7)	Supply & install 1/450 RCP culvert extension.<br /><br />8)	Supply & install upper embankment.<br /><br />9)	Supply & install soil nails, including grout & weepholes.<br /><br />10)	Shotcreting including supply & installation of mesh.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads - RoadTek<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520488<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Environmental & Heritage Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
