<item><title>Rosny Creative Precinct - Business Case Consultancy Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Clarence invites Quotations from suitably qualified Respondents to provide Business Case Consultancy Services for the Rosny Creative Precinct Business Case and Master Plan project.<br /><br />The consultancy forms part of an integrated multidisciplinary project to develop a Strategic and Detailed Business Case and Precinct Master Plan to Development Application level.<br /><br />The City of Clarence is leading planning for a multi-use Cultural and Creative Industries Precinct at Rosny Parklands, adjacent to Rosny Farm, the City’s principal cultural facility. In November 2025, Council secured $1.67 million through the Australian Government’s urban Precincts and Partnerships Program to develop a Business Case and Precinct Master Plan for the proposed precinct.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Clarence<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Hobart time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520308<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Business & Administrative Services, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
