<item><title>PSA00222 Technical Security Services – CCTV Services and Alarm &amp; Access Control Systems</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Townsville City Council (Principal) invites submissions from suitable qualified and experienced contractors for the provision of Closed-Circuit Television (CCTV) services, including maintenance, reactive repairs, and installations. Along with Access Control platform is the Gallagher system. The Supplier is engaged to undertake scheduled maintenance, corrective repairs, and installation of access control infrastructure across the Principals facilities.<br /><br /><br />A Supplier Briefing will be held on Thursday 13th August 2026 at 1pm at Townsville City Council Local Disaster Coordination Centre,113-123 Dalrymple Road, Garbutt QLD 4814. As per information held in the Tender Conditions document<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Townsville City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520276<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Security Services & Equipment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
