<item><title>Consultancy Services - Sir Joseph Banks Park - Foreshore Road Carpark Design</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Lead Consultancy for the design of a carpark within Sir Joseph Banks Park with frontage to Foreshore Road, Botany. The carpark design must appropriately consider the interface with the park, its character and context. The Lead consultant will be required to engage sub-consultants to deliver the design. The program is to allow for site investigations, concept design options, community engagement materials, detailed design, and a fully coordinated set of IFT and IFC documentation. For detailed information and project requirements refer to Appendix A.<br /><br />Contract award is anticipated to be late November 2026 with the program commencing in December 2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Bayside Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Sep/2026 09:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520226<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
