<item><title>CQURFQ-26-36-DFM - ROK Fleet Carpark - Construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> CQUniversity is undertaking the consolidation of its TAFE operations into the Rockhampton North Campus as part of the University's broader campus redevelopment program. This project includes the construction of new facilities to support the expanded educational footprint.<br /><br />To facilitate these works, the existing fleet vehicle car park is required to be relocated to accommodate the proposed building footprint.<br /><br />This Request for Quote (RFQ) seeks submissions from suitably qualified contractors to undertake the construction of a new fleet vehicle car park, including all associated civil, security, and accessibility works necessary to deliver a complete and operational facility.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Queensland University<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519986<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
