<category>Transport, Freight, Logistics</category>
</item>
<item><title>Rectification of the Wolgan Road Landslip</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Lithgow City Council is seeking proposals from suitable consultants to design and construct a solution to a roadside landslip on Wolgan Road, within the Wolgan Valley. The section of road affected is positioned adjacent to the Wolgan River. In 2022, following a heavy rain event, the river rose significantly and scoured the side of the bank away, leading to the landslip, affecting the roadway above.<br /><br />The site is located within the Wolgan Valley and access is currently restricted due to a larger landslip that has led to construction of a temporary access road known as the 'Donkey Steps'.<br /><br />A mandatory site inspection is scheduled for 10:30am, Tuesday 18th August. Further details regarding this inspection are included in Volume 1 of the tender documents.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Lithgow City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Sep/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519788<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=bc78d08613694b618c14a0f6e6160892s519788</link>
