<item><title>IRC-CS-0426-EOI473 EOI - Management of Glenden Recreation Centre</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Dear Sir / Madam,<br /><br />Isaac Regional Council is seeking Expressions of Interest to manage the Glenden Recreation Centre located at 251 Ewan Drive, Glenden. <br /><br />The scope of management includes all areas of the facility, including the gym.<br /><br />The successful respondent will develop and coordinate a range of services, programs, activities and events that are flexible, culturally inclusive and aim to build skills, provide knowledge, promote personal and social development, promote physical well-being, and create and sustain local networks.<br /><br />If you require an inspection of the facility it can be arranged by messaging through VendorPanel with a couple of proposed dates and times.<br /><br />Please ensure your written expression of interest is lodged prior to the Closing Time, being 2pm Tuesday, 04 August 2026 AEST.<br /><br />All specification, general enquiries and written expression of interests must be submitted via VendorPanel only. Please do not send directly to Project Manager...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Isaac Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP516127<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Sport, Recreation Equip, Services, Training & Development, Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=db2cf563a0254247b85d542d0988e6fds516127</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">db2cf563a0254247b85d542d0988e6fd</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 01:46:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Sport, Recreation Equip, Services</category>
